# Stops the touchpad (i2c device PIXA3854:00) from waking the laptop from sleep; see docs/framework16-sleep.md. Matching
# the device name keeps other I2C devices' wake settings alone; the attribute test makes repeated events a no-op.
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="i2c", KERNEL=="i2c-PIXA3854:*", ATTR{power/wakeup}=="enabled", ATTR{power/wakeup}="disabled"
